@startuml
[*] --> Order : Newly acquired plane
Order --> Arrival : upon arrival
Arrival --> Preparation : upon arrival
alt Condition and schedule -> Operations
  Preparation --> Operations : prepared plane assigned to operations
else
  Preparation --> Maintenance : prepared plane assigned to maintenance
end

Operations --> Maintenance : no more scheduled flights or maintenance required
Maintenance --> Preparation : after checking and servicing
Preparation --> Operations : plane ready for operations
Operations --> #Red Withdrawn : plane permanently withdrawn from service
Maintenance --> #Red Withdrawn : plane permanently withdrawn from service
Withdrawn --> [*] : final state

@enduml
